  "description": "Bayan at foundation settings — the classic Russian concert button accordion in its most grounded voice. Full bellows pressure, low buzz threshold, formant centered. No drone, just the reeds speaking clearly in their natural frequency range. The instrument that taught generations of Soviet concert halls what an accordion could be.",
